
# Khan Technical Taleem

**Afghanistan Telecom Packages App**

## About
Khan Technical Taleem is an Android application project designed to help users in Afghanistan find and explore mobile network packages easily.

## Founder
Keftan Khan

## Country
Afghanistan

## Supported Languages
- English
- Pashto

## Supported Mobile Networks
- Roshan
- Afghan Wireless (AWCC)
- Etisalat Afghanistan
- ATOMA
- Salaam

## Main Features
- Internet packages
- Voice and call packages
- SMS packages
- Social media packages
- Night packages
- Special offers
- Package prices in AFN
- Package validity and activation codes
- Search and filters
- Copy USSD activation codes
- Offline access to saved package information
- Automatic online package updates
- Pashto and English language support

## Admin Panel
A secure admin panel is planned to manage mobile networks, packages, prices, activation codes, validity, and special offers.

## Technology
- Flutter
- Firebase
- Offline local database

